  m_text: '<u>Characteristics:</u>

    - Autonomy

    - Interaction: Coordination,
    Co-operation, Competition.

    - Adaptability

    - Distributed control: When
    1 agent fails, the whole system doesn''t stop.

    - Scalability: Variable number
    of agents.

    - Heterogeneity: Different agent architectures in 1 system.

    -
    Decentralized data and knowledge: Contributes to robustness by eliminating single
    points of failure.'
